* SH-101 VCF (docs/circuit-filter.md 2-3): source mixer input through R111 470k and C45, IC14
* IR3109 with its 68k/68k/560 networks and 240 pF capacitors, the resonance loop (VR18, TR26,
* TR27, C52, R129, D30/D31, R113), the output sum (R130, R132) into C53 and R139.
* compare_vcf.py fills in IABC, the VR18 halves RTOP/RBOT, the source and the analysis.
.include models.lib
Vbus bus 0 5.0
* R135 is on SN p.7's filled arrow: +14 V, TR3's emitter (14.3 V, U-Labor). 25 C, as the model.
.options temp=25
V14 v14 0 14.3
V9 v9 0 9.0

* Source mixer: one source through its mixing resistor (the saw's R111 470k), C45 10u BP.
{SOURCE}
R111 src mix 470k
C45 mix in1 10u

* IR3109 and its networks (R114/R117/R118/R119/R121/R124/R122 68k, R115/R116/R120/R123 560).
XIC14 bus in1 cap1 out1 in2 cap2 out2 0 vc in3 cap3 out3 in4 cap4 out4 v9 IR3109 PARAMS: iabc={IABC}
Vvc vc bus 0
R115 in1 b560 560
R116 in2 b560 560
R120 in3 b560 560
R123 in4 b560 560
C46 b560 0 2.2u
Rb560 b560 bus 0.01
R114 out1 in1 68k
R117 out1 in2 68k
R118 out2 in2 68k
R119 out2 in3 68k
R121 out3 in3 68k
R124 out3 in4 68k
R122 out4 in4 68k
C48 cap1 bus 240p
C47 cap2 bus 240p
C50 cap3 bus 240p
C51 cap4 bus 240p

* Resonance: VR18 100k B from OUT4 to the bus (OML's correction), wiper to TR26.
RVtop out4 wip {RTOP}
RVbot wip bus {RBOT}
Q26 c26 wip e26 Q2SC1815
R131 e26 0 10k
R136 c54 c26 15k
R135 v14 c54 1k
C54 c54 0 10u
Q27 c54 c26 e27 Q2SC1815
R137 e27 0 33k
