R129 n52 dnode 5.6k
D30 dnode bus D1S
D31 bus dnode D1S
R113 dnode in1 15k

* Output: R130 (OUT4) and R132 (TR26's emitter) into C53, R139 1k to the bus (R138 on pin 2).
R130 out4 jn 150k
R132 e26 jn 150k
